{"id":"W657c9dc0eede974521feb4e0","zh":"伤损识别","en":"","name":"伤损识别","language":"zh","domain":"车辆轨道随机动力学","concept_id":"Cadf72024a0868b8fced7","families":[],"definition_zh":"利用观测或计算信息判别基础结构是否发生损伤及其状态。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":"用于通过正常与伤损状态下结构响应分布的差异，判断损伤的位置和程度。在胶垫伤损分析中，响应分布的变化可作为识别胶垫伤损状态的依据。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W657c9dc0eede974521feb4e0","text":"伤损识别","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sc30f0e5b00c25bf0a4f9","source_id":"P112","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"(2)由于本文的研究重点为线路基础部件的伤损识别,故取较小的线路系统参数随机域,即:各参数正态分布中的标准差较小,同一基础结构层的线路参数相关系数区间为0.","citations":[{"source_id":"P112","page":5,"page_end":5}]},{"id":"S52c04bf8fc6bfcbcbe58","source_id":"P112","page":6,"page_end":6,"language":"zh","text":"(2)以往的研究工作多取确定性的实测或仿真信号进行伤损识别,忽视了线路在循环随机荷载等因素作用下的时变本质。","citations":[{"source_id":"P112","page":6,"page_end":6}]}],"sources":{"P112":{"id":"P112","title":"用于铁路线路基础结构伤损识别的概率密度分布演化方法","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明,陈宪麦,陶伟峰","year":"2018","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2018.12.014","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-probability-density-distribution-evolution-method-for-damage-detection-of-railway-infrastructure"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"依据正常与伤损响应分布的差异判断胶垫伤损位置和程度。","language":"zh","source_id":"P112","paper_slug":"2018-probability-density-distribution-evolution-method-for-damage-detection-of-railway-infrastructure","title":"用于铁路线路基础结构伤损识别的概率密度分布演化方法","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W263ddc2c6ad662cb5471246f","name":"damage detection","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W263ddc2c6ad662cb5471246f","name":"damage detection","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_la